<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="16px" color="#333333" line-height="24px" />
      <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="20px" />
      <mj-button
        background-color="#7E317B"
        color="#ffffff"
        font-weight="bold"
        border-radius="4px"
      />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      .header-text {
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#f4f4f4">
    <mj-section background-color="#7E317B" padding="40px 20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          width="300px"
          src="https://harryrich02.github.io/DUMC/img/dumcCrest.png"
          alt="DUMC Crest"
        />
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="28px"
          font-weight="900"
          css-class="header-text"
        >
          WAD WEEKLY
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="30px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          Welcome to the WAD Weekly during the first week of pain. Remember to take care of yourselves the next few weeks!
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-bottom="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="22px" font-weight="bold" color="#7E317B"
          >📅 COMING UP</mj-text
        >
        <mj-divider border-width="2px" border-color="#7E317B" />
        <mj-text>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Thu 8:00pm:</strong> Team Training (DCC)</li>
            <li>
              <strong>Mon 7:30pm:</strong> Beer & Boulder (DCC + The Water
              House)
            </li>
          </ul>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#fafafa">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="22px" font-weight="bold" color="#7E317B"
          >🧗 LAST WEEK IN THE DUMC</mj-text
        >
        <mj-divider border-width="2px" border-color="#7E317B" />

        <mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold"
          >Annual Spring Boulder Open</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text>
          A very good final competition of the year, with impressive turn outs from the club (considering exam season). Amazing efforts from all, especially with so many other competitors. Congratulations to Max and Minipher for both making finals, coming 2nd and 4th! All in all good effort and good fun. Honourable mention to Miranda for getting injured on a feet first with a sick scratch to show for it.</br>
          </br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Max - 2nd</br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Ethan - 12th</br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Toby - 17th</br>
          </br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Minipher - 4th</br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rachel - 12th</br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Miranda - 14th</br>
          <strong>- Ethan</strong>
        </mj-text>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="40px">
      <mj-column border="2px dashed #7E317B" border-radius="10px">
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="20px"
          font-weight="bold"
          color="#7E317B"
          >💪 WAD OF THE WEEK</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text align="center" font-style="italic">
          Max and Minipher for a great performance at ASBO
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="20px" padding-bottom="40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          <strong>Harry Richards</strong><br />
          DUMC President
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#222222" padding="40px 20px">
      <mj-column vertical-align="middle">
        <mj-image
          width="120px"
          src="https://harryrich02.github.io/DUMC/img/dumcLogo.png"
          alt="DUMC Logo"
        />
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column vertical-align="middle">
        <mj-text
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="14px"
          align="center"
          padding-bottom="10px"
        >
          <strong>Durham University Mountaineering Club</strong>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-social font-size="15px" icon-size="30px" mode="horizontal">
          <mj-social-element
            name="instagram"
            href="https://www.instagram.com/du.mountaineering"
            background-color="#7E317B"
          ></mj-social-element>
          <mj-social-element
            name="facebook"
            href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/DUMC.Forum"
            background-color="#7E317B"
          ></mj-social-element>
        </mj-social>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="13px" padding-top="15px">
          <a
            href="https://mountaineeringclub.webspace.durham.ac.uk/"
            style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline"
            >Visit our Website</a
          >
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
